# Build (TuyaOS)

## Working directory

Run **every** `make` command from:

`T5_TuyaOS-3.13.6/software/TuyaOS/`

## Targets (`APP_NAME` is always `tuyaos_jiajia`)

| Goal | Command |
|------|---------|
| Choose / load board default config | `make app_config_choice APP_NAME=tuyaos_jiajia` |
| Interactive feature toggles | `make app_menuconfig APP_NAME=tuyaos_jiajia` |
| Regenerate `tuya_app_config.h` from configs | `make app_config APP_NAME=tuyaos_jiajia` |
| **Typical firmware build** | `make app APP_NAME=tuyaos_jiajia` |
| Rebuild SDK pieces (slow) | `make os APP_NAME=tuyaos_jiajia` |
| Clean app output | `make clean APP_NAME=tuyaos_jiajia` |
| Clean app + SDK static libs | `make os_clean APP_NAME=tuyaos_jiajia` |

**Build output:** `output/T5_tuyaos_jiajia/` under that same TuyaOS directory.
